# Testing and git

- Fake Embedder/LLM interfaces; tests need no API keys.
- Coverage target ≥ 80% on ingestion/, retrieval/, services/.
- Conventional Commits: feat/fix/test/docs/chore/refactor/ci.
- One logical change per commit. Run checks before committing.
- Never fabricate metrics, screenshots, or AI_LOG entries.
